WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.300
video file & English subtitles: Safex

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:05.671
Candy saved Susanna during a snowstorm.

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:10.106
Leave me alone!
Leave me alone!

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.173
Please, stay alive, Susanna!

00:00:18.953 --> 00:00:21.588
Susanna is deeply in love with Terry.

00:00:21.856 --> 00:00:26.152
She was injured because of him.

00:00:26.302 --> 00:00:28.559
She loves Terry so much.

00:00:30.598 --> 00:00:34.294
Candy wishes Terry and Susanna
to be happy together...

00:00:34.544 --> 00:00:37.570
As she is leaving her footprints
on snowy Broadway.

00:00:38.606 --> 00:00:44.272
The Platform of sorrow.

00:01:34.195 --> 00:01:35.423
Candy!

00:01:37.432 --> 00:01:38.956
Don't leave me...

00:01:39.334 --> 00:01:43.434
Let the time stop here...
...here forever.

00:01:44.088 --> 00:01:45.487
Terry...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.417
Don't say anything,
just let me hold you.

00:01:49.944 --> 00:01:53.243
He is crying... Terry is crying...

00:01:53.948 --> 00:01:58.715
Terry, my love...
We are separating this way.

00:01:59.621 --> 00:02:02.488
Be happy... be happy, Candy,

00:02:03.491 --> 00:02:06.016
otherwise, I will not forgive you.

00:02:07.295 --> 00:02:09.559
Terry... you too.

00:02:15.937 --> 00:02:18.462
Why did I come to Broadway?

00:02:19.407 --> 00:02:21.034
Why?

00:02:23.745 --> 00:02:25.337
I feel very hot.

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:27.575
I am getting a fever.

00:02:27.849 --> 00:02:33.310
I probably caught a cold
walking in the snow.

00:02:51.606 --> 00:02:53.700
He's so noisy! Keep him quiet!

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:55.398
Sorry.

00:02:55.548 --> 00:02:58.445
Darling, it's ok, don't be afraid.

00:03:02.217 --> 00:03:03.514
Sorry.

00:03:03.952 --> 00:03:07.161
Please, take my seat.

00:03:07.311 --> 00:03:08.380
But...

00:03:10.124 --> 00:03:14.686
I am fine. Please have a seat.
Poor little baby!

00:03:15.029 --> 00:03:16.484
Thank you.

00:03:16.634 --> 00:03:19.294
- You are doing us a great favour.
- I am sorry.

00:03:20.168 --> 00:03:22.466
It's okay. Don't cry.

00:03:23.238 --> 00:03:24.603
Here.

00:03:26.374 --> 00:03:29.969
Great! The baby seems to like it!

00:03:36.784 --> 00:03:37.977
He fell asleep.

00:03:38.127 --> 00:03:40.111
Thank you very much.

00:03:40.455 --> 00:03:42.480
Thank you for your help.

00:03:43.124 --> 00:03:44.591
You're welcome!

00:03:45.994 --> 00:03:49.838
Stear, the music box of happiness
you gave me

00:03:49.988 --> 00:03:53.422
made a baby happy.

00:04:01.676 --> 00:04:05.737
They look so happy together...

00:04:07.549 --> 00:04:09.039
I wished...

00:04:09.384 --> 00:04:12.715
to have that kind of happiness
with Terry.

00:04:13.655 --> 00:04:16.566
Forever...

00:04:16.716 --> 00:04:19.518
But it was only a dream.

00:04:19.668 --> 00:04:21.959
And the dream is over.

00:04:35.877 --> 00:04:37.174
Terry!

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:48.214
We will meet again.

00:04:48.489 --> 00:04:53.426
Of course, we will.
I always believed that.

00:04:53.861 --> 00:04:55.555
But, we can't see each other again.

00:04:55.705 --> 00:05:00.124
We can't.

00:05:01.569 --> 00:05:03.230
Terry!

00:05:34.702 --> 00:05:37.193
Miss, what's wrong? Miss!

00:05:40.141 --> 00:05:41.540
She has a very high fever.

00:05:41.976 --> 00:05:44.501
Does she have any ID?

00:05:47.315 --> 00:05:48.612
A letter.

00:05:49.017 --> 00:05:51.311
Candice White Adley.

00:05:51.461 --> 00:05:52.912
She is from the Adley family!

00:05:53.062 --> 00:05:55.353
I will contact them immediately!

00:06:06.034 --> 00:06:08.502
Where's the music coming from?

00:06:09.037 --> 00:06:10.800
It's Stear's music box.

00:06:17.345 --> 00:06:19.639
Candy, this music box
will make you happy.

00:06:19.789 --> 00:06:23.109
Stear, I don't feel happy
with this melody.

00:06:23.259 --> 00:06:25.414
Your invention failed.

00:06:27.655 --> 00:06:29.646
Why are you laughing? Who are you?

00:06:30.391 --> 00:06:32.120
Perfume of roses.

00:06:32.427 --> 00:06:33.792
Anthony...

00:06:37.231 --> 00:06:40.667
No, these are Terry's roses!

00:06:40.835 --> 00:06:42.969
From Terry's fans.

00:06:47.175 --> 00:06:50.667
Don't leave, Terry! Don't leave!

00:06:54.382 --> 00:06:59.979
- I am here...
- Candy!

00:07:01.189 --> 00:07:04.215
Candy, hang in there.

00:07:11.566 --> 00:07:12.659
Annie.

00:07:12.809 --> 00:07:14.727
Thank Goodness!
You recovered at last.

00:07:14.877 --> 00:07:15.928
Where am I?

00:07:16.078 --> 00:07:17.597
You're at the Adley's home.

00:07:17.747 --> 00:07:20.433
You fainted on the train.

00:07:20.583 --> 00:07:23.569
But, why am I in the Adley's home?

00:07:23.719 --> 00:07:25.874
You had an addressed letter with you.

00:07:26.247 --> 00:07:29.509
The letter with the invitation
Terry sent me.

00:07:29.659 --> 00:07:33.520
Archie went to get you
as soon as he got notified.

00:07:34.222 --> 00:07:35.481
Archie?

00:07:35.631 --> 00:07:38.252
Candy, you are a nurse.
How come you became ill?

00:07:38.559 --> 00:07:42.188
You nearly caught pneumonia.

00:07:42.797 --> 00:07:44.094
Yes!

00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:47.026
Candy.

00:07:47.376 --> 00:07:48.995
Patty, Archie!

00:07:49.145 --> 00:07:51.971
Thank Goodness!
You've woken up, Candy!

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:54.938
I am fine, I only fainted.

00:07:56.911 --> 00:07:58.173
Candy...

00:07:59.747 --> 00:08:00.873
Patty...

00:08:01.023 --> 00:08:04.111
Why did this happen?

00:08:10.458 --> 00:08:13.352
Archie and Annie...
Everyone knows

00:08:13.502 --> 00:08:15.793
that I broke up with Terry.

00:08:15.997 --> 00:08:20.457
I must cheer up and don't upset them.

00:08:24.005 --> 00:08:26.997
Patty, don't cry. Cheer up!

00:08:27.275 --> 00:08:31.473
It's a pity,
but this is how life goes.

00:08:31.679 --> 00:08:33.078
Candy!

00:08:34.816 --> 00:08:36.709
I can't accept this!

00:08:36.859 --> 00:08:39.719
He didn't even say goodbye.
He didn't even say a word!

00:08:40.655 --> 00:08:44.182
Goodbye? Who?

00:08:47.461 --> 00:08:49.725
That's right... Where is Stear?

00:08:51.132 --> 00:08:53.327
Patty, who didn't say goodbye?

00:08:53.568 --> 00:08:55.934
Everybody, where is Stear?

00:08:56.437 --> 00:08:57.864
Annie!

00:09:01.509 --> 00:09:06.276
Brother joined the army in France.

00:09:08.015 --> 00:09:11.849
Stear joined the army in France?

00:09:12.787 --> 00:09:14.180
So,

00:09:14.330 --> 00:09:18.618
the war in Europe is worsening.

00:09:18.768 --> 00:09:21.387
He left after you went to Broadway.

00:09:21.537 --> 00:09:26.399
He didn't say a thing,
he only left a note.

00:09:27.435 --> 00:09:31.997
That morning on the platform,
Stear saw me away.

00:09:32.506 --> 00:09:35.568
At that time, Stear had already
made up his mind.

00:09:35.718 --> 00:09:38.806
It's a pity to travel alone.

00:09:45.353 --> 00:09:48.481
Did he come to say goodbye to me?

00:09:49.757 --> 00:09:53.921
How come I didn't notice anything?

00:10:05.740 --> 00:10:07.037
Stear...

00:10:10.344 --> 00:10:11.604
This is too much, Candy!

00:10:11.754 --> 00:10:15.615
He left this letter
hoping I would understand him.

00:10:21.155 --> 00:10:22.645
Dear Patricia,

00:10:23.090 --> 00:10:26.491
I hope you will not blame me for this.

00:10:26.827 --> 00:10:30.456
As I am writing this letter,
I am thinking of your smile.

00:10:30.606 --> 00:10:32.592
I decided to join the army.

00:10:32.742 --> 00:10:35.862
Please understand I don't
just want to fly an airplane.

00:10:36.012 --> 00:10:40.874
We will meet again.
Farewell.

00:10:41.342 --> 00:10:45.371
We will meet again?
What if he dies?

00:10:45.521 --> 00:10:48.415
Patty, don't think like this!

00:11:01.462 --> 00:11:04.952
Patty, don't be sad.

00:11:05.102 --> 00:11:08.262
What Stear needs
is your understanding.

00:11:08.602 --> 00:11:12.265
It's true. You are the friend
Brother liked the most.

00:11:12.990 --> 00:11:15.268
If he liked me so much,
why did he lie to me, then?

00:11:15.418 --> 00:11:16.903
Why didn't he tell me?

00:11:17.053 --> 00:11:22.439
Patty, please stop crying.
Life is always full of changes.

00:11:26.687 --> 00:11:30.487
I broke up with Terry...

00:11:30.758 --> 00:11:32.885
I couldn't do anything about it.

00:11:33.394 --> 00:11:36.122
I didn't pay attention to
Brother's thoughts.

00:11:36.272 --> 00:11:40.293
I always thought he was just joking.

00:11:41.002 --> 00:11:42.367
Archie...

00:11:45.006 --> 00:11:47.474
Terry... Stear...

00:11:47.742 --> 00:11:49.869
My head is pounding...

00:11:57.485 --> 00:11:59.077
Aunt...

00:12:01.322 --> 00:12:03.984
How dare you come here?

00:12:06.193 --> 00:12:10.095
Archie, why did you bring her
back here?

00:12:10.464 --> 00:12:12.523
This isn't our daughter!
This is a shame.

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:18.199
I can't accept she is a member
of the Adley's family.

00:12:20.274 --> 00:12:24.366
Ever since you arrive in the Adley family,
only bad things happened to us.

00:12:24.516 --> 00:12:29.508
Anthony died,
Grandfather William never came back.

00:12:29.658 --> 00:12:31.881
And now... now it's Stear.

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:34.615
First it was Anthony,
and then Stear...

00:12:34.955 --> 00:12:39.618
Great Aunt Elroy has lost
two young members of the family.

00:12:39.768 --> 00:12:42.890
Adopting you was Grandfather
William's biggest mistake.

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:46.529
I can't stand this any longer!

00:12:47.168 --> 00:12:51.897
I won't allow you to step into
this house anymore!

00:12:52.047 --> 00:12:53.099
Great Aunt...

00:12:53.249 --> 00:12:54.903
It's alright.

00:12:56.677 --> 00:12:58.645
Candice White Adley.

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:02.149
I wanted to give this name up
long time ago.

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:04.447
Candy, you have fever.

00:13:04.785 --> 00:13:06.343
I have to leave now.

00:13:06.787 --> 00:13:10.814
I didn't know you would
still have a sense of shame.

00:13:11.025 --> 00:13:13.386
Listen carefully,
never come here again!

00:13:13.536 --> 00:13:15.354
Great Aunt, you are being very harsh.

00:13:15.504 --> 00:13:17.690
Don't be so cruel.

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.494
That's ok, Archie.

00:13:19.900 --> 00:13:22.328
Eliza and Neil will be back
in the afternoon.

00:13:22.478 --> 00:13:24.963
We will discuss about Stear then.

00:13:31.612 --> 00:13:32.905
Candy, I am sorry.

00:13:33.055 --> 00:13:35.307
Great Aunt Elroy
has always been like this.

00:13:35.457 --> 00:13:37.510
And since Brother left, she became worse.

00:13:37.660 --> 00:13:40.312
No, I can understand her.

00:13:40.462 --> 00:13:42.150
Are you all right, Candy?

00:13:43.023 --> 00:13:44.717
Patty, Cheer up.

00:13:44.867 --> 00:13:48.228
Stear said you would meet again.

00:13:49.964 --> 00:13:53.229
He will come back soon, just like before.

00:13:54.201 --> 00:13:55.600
Really?

00:13:55.769 --> 00:13:57.630
Of course he will.

00:13:57.780 --> 00:14:01.102
His letter said so.
He didn't leave us for good.

00:14:03.010 --> 00:14:05.069
Will he really come back?

00:14:07.148 --> 00:14:10.879
A real goodbye is a goodbye forever...

00:14:11.752 --> 00:14:13.511
Just like Terry and me.

00:14:20.628 --> 00:14:23.522
Stear, I would like to see you so much

00:14:23.672 --> 00:14:26.623
and complain to you about
the music box of happiness.

00:14:29.036 --> 00:14:31.800
What kind of music box is that?
It didn't bring me any happiness!

00:14:32.173 --> 00:14:34.733
This is the music box of break ups!

00:14:35.643 --> 00:14:37.201
That's too bad.

00:14:38.445 --> 00:14:41.209
He would probably say sorry to me
and apologize.

00:14:41.916 --> 00:14:43.042
Stear...

00:14:54.962 --> 00:14:56.255
Are you all right, Candy?

00:14:56.405 --> 00:14:57.823
Be careful in the stairs.

00:14:57.973 --> 00:14:59.490
That's ok.

00:15:01.569 --> 00:15:03.929
My mind and body are tired.

00:15:04.079 --> 00:15:07.500
I hope Mr. Albert can make me
feel more relaxed.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:09.736
He sure will.

00:15:13.781 --> 00:15:16.511
Mr. Albert!
Mr. Albert!

00:15:21.755 --> 00:15:22.681
Candy...

00:15:22.831 --> 00:15:24.519
Mr. Albert.

00:15:27.294 --> 00:15:29.057
Welcome back, Candy.

00:15:30.598 --> 00:15:32.759
-Candy!
-She has a high fever.

00:15:32.967 --> 00:15:34.226
And she fainted on the train.

00:15:34.376 --> 00:15:36.531
They notified us.

00:15:36.704 --> 00:15:39.002
I see... Thank you.

00:15:48.082 --> 00:15:49.913
Is Candy going to be ok?

00:15:53.754 --> 00:15:57.121
Don't worry about Candy,
I will take care of her.

00:15:57.791 --> 00:16:00.225
Thank you, Mr. Albert.

00:16:01.161 --> 00:16:05.357
Archie, you must be worried
about Stear being overseas.

00:16:05.507 --> 00:16:06.892
Yes.

00:16:07.042 --> 00:16:09.959
Stear will come back.

00:16:10.771 --> 00:16:12.068
Goodbye, Mr. Albert.

00:16:12.239 --> 00:16:14.298
Please take care of Candy.

00:16:14.775 --> 00:16:17.369
Leave it to me.
I will take good care of her.

00:16:24.118 --> 00:16:29.055
Candy is ill.
That doesn't happen very often.

00:16:37.965 --> 00:16:39.523
Candy...

00:16:45.472 --> 00:16:47.264
What's wrong?

00:16:47.414 --> 00:16:49.399
Mr. Albert...

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:51.703
Mr. Albert!

00:16:55.683 --> 00:16:59.642
Terry... it is finished between us.

00:17:03.424 --> 00:17:05.949
We saw each other again.

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:12.460
But now, we can't see each other anymore.

00:17:13.834 --> 00:17:15.267
Candy...

00:17:15.502 --> 00:17:18.437
If Susanna was selfish,

00:17:18.906 --> 00:17:22.205
it would have been better!

00:17:25.913 --> 00:17:27.312
Let me go!

00:17:27.514 --> 00:17:30.677
Staying alive will only
make Terry suffer more,

00:17:30.851 --> 00:17:33.078
and you will not be happy either.

00:17:33.228 --> 00:17:34.313
Susanna!

00:17:34.463 --> 00:17:38.620
Let me die...
for Terry, I must die.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:41.720
I can't let you do it.

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:46.494
You are suffering,
and Terry suffers too.

00:17:50.137 --> 00:17:51.597
Leave me alone, Candy.

00:17:51.747 --> 00:17:54.800
I will only get between you two.

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:58.936
Stay alive, Susanna!
Stay alive!

00:18:08.322 --> 00:18:12.588
She would have rather died
to make Terry and me happy.

00:18:13.227 --> 00:18:18.459
I love Terry...
but I can't say a word about it!

00:18:24.405 --> 00:18:27.863
If I were you,
I would have done the same thing.

00:18:28.976 --> 00:18:33.504
Candy, would you still like Terry
if he abandoned Susanna?

00:18:47.127 --> 00:18:51.860
This is the Terry that I love!

00:18:58.539 --> 00:19:01.975
Cry, Candy, and forget all.

00:19:17.991 --> 00:19:19.151
Are you tired?

00:19:19.326 --> 00:19:20.850
Have a good rest.

00:19:22.262 --> 00:19:24.287
The fever is gone.

00:19:25.098 --> 00:19:29.762
The fever must have got scared
of my crying!

00:19:31.905 --> 00:19:34.601
If you can joke,
then you are feeling better.

00:19:35.943 --> 00:19:38.302
Now Candy, I am going
to get something to eat.

00:19:38.452 --> 00:19:41.073
Thank you, Mr. Albert.

00:19:41.223 --> 00:19:43.480
Poope, look after Candy.

00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.387
Come here, Poope!

00:19:53.861 --> 00:19:58.195
I feel safe with Mr. Albert
taking care of me.

00:20:13.847 --> 00:20:15.644
- Can you take both bags, Sir?
- Sure.

00:20:22.422 --> 00:20:24.754
I'll make some soup for Candy.

00:20:25.292 --> 00:20:27.226
I miss Candy's smile.

00:20:27.461 --> 00:20:29.224
I'll do my best
so she gets well very soon.

00:20:32.299 --> 00:20:33.493
Watch out!

00:20:41.174 --> 00:20:42.869
- What happened?
- The car hit him!

00:20:55.722 --> 00:20:58.150
Why is everybody yelling around me?

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:01.668
I am getting dizzy... very dizzy.

00:21:10.818 --> 00:21:15.000
Candy has no idea that
Mr. Albert just had an accident.

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.771
and she is sleeping with her mind at rest.
